  <item>
    <title>EP053《狂野时代》做个好梦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6964d845c2a4d16ea7857b2f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6964d845c2a4d16ea7857b2f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Jan 2026 11:49:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>豆瓣简介：影片讲述“迷魂者”（易烊千玺 饰）通过体验视觉、听觉、味觉、嗅觉、触觉五感，跨越一个世纪的故事。而“大她者”（舒淇 饰）则好似是打开“迷魂者”故事的钥匙......</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目详情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">00:02:01</a>《地球最后的夜晚》：商业电影与文艺片导演的口碑之争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">00:09:43</a>《狂野时代》：一部引人入胜的电影之旅，剧情与惊喜的完美结合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">00:19:25</a>诺兰的出道作《记忆碎片》：一个叙事方式的颠覆与创新</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1752">00:29:12</a>《怪物造型与电影表达》：导演毕赣的创意与演员沟通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2335">00:38:55</a>边缘者的命运：电影中角色的前世与今生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2919">00:48:39</a>从文艺到都市爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4089">01:08:09</a>自我探索与外在世界的交融：一个藏身者的成长之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4669">01:17:49</a>电影创作的学院派与叛逆风格：毕干的导演之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5256">01:27:36</a>电影行业的艰难之路：导演之路的不易与挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5840">01:37:20</a>莫言与学院派的冲突：文学创作的困境与突破</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6425">01:47:05</a>导演之路：展现作品实力的关键，而不是辈分或人脉</span></p>]]></description>
